## Why This Is Asked

This explores testing distributed, real-time collaboration systems, edge traffic, and resilience to downstream outages beyond simple load tests.

## Key Concepts

- End-to-end latency budgets in real-time apps
- Presence replication and Redis throughput
- Edge caching effectiveness and cache invalidation
- Event streaming with Kafka and backpressure
- Chaos and outage scenarios (doc-merge service)

## Code Example

